{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05680","headline":"江行有怀 · 孙逖","name":"江行有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋水明川路，轻舟转石圻。\n霜多山橘熟，寒至浦禽稀。\n飞席乘风势，回流荡日晖。\n昼行疑海若，夕梦识江妃。\n野霁看吴尽，天长望洛非。\n不知何岁月，一似暮潮归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙逖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05680.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05680","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}